    // We choose c = y_{i+1} such that c != b
    // Then we check if b is a local max or min:
    //   if a < b > c: then b is a local max, new mc = mc + 1, new mnc = mnc
    //   if a > b < c: then b is a local min, new mc = mc, new mnc = mnc + 1
    //   otherwise: new mc = mc, new mnc = mnc
